  "content_text": "I was inspired by some of the awesome stills work that has been posted on this forum, and I thought i’d share a few frames as well. Film photography has been a refreshing creative outlet in the last few years, it makes me slow down….and learn to meter better haha. All of these were shot on a Rolleiflex, and developed/scanned at home (except for the goat, which was on E6 and I sent to a lab). Cheers!",
  "content_html": "<p>I was inspired by some of the awesome stills work that has been posted on this forum, and I thought i’d share a few frames as well. Film photography has been a refreshing creative outlet in the last few years, it makes me slow down….and learn to meter better haha. All of these were shot on a Rolleiflex, and developed/scanned at home (except for the goat, which was on E6 and I sent to a lab). Cheers!</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/25uss8xxx8vrfu870qr7mq8l5g5vlpn8.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/qsbdghfn2s4baeqdf58o8gkz6qpogip6.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/n055aksjkrehaqy1wtrpbfbiqh3qysca.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/17zbuaco18favwvrzawzug5oofoca3l6.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/c0idvt91o7dyidqy0utsq5sd1x5w905h.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/8bkmle0cedz8hg8m4b8ale1zihg4l522.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/cec6mdvi2stduog3770ht6zlm2iwv9ow.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/wp-content/uploads/hm_bbpui/216636/l9m14krl71fnp13bppvvzwx6173u6b2z.jpg\"/></p>\n<p> </p>",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I was inspired by some of the awesome stills work that has been posted on this forum, and I thought i’d share a few frames as well. Film photography has been a refreshing creative outlet in the last few years, it makes me slow down….and learn to meter better haha. All of these were shot on a Rolleiflex, and developed/scanned at home (except for the goat, which was on E6 and I sent to a lab). Cheers!"
    }
